@startuml medication-database

title Database

hide circle
skinparam linetype ortho

database "piolla" {
    package medication {
        entity "organizations" as organizations {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            name: VARCHAR
            tax_identification_number: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
            country_iso_code: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
        }

        entity "medicinal_products" as medicinal_products {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            name: VARCHAR
            brand_name: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
            medication_id: UUID <<FK>>
        }

        entity "medicinal_product_organizations" as medicinal_product_organizations {
            * medicinal_product_id: UUID <<PK, FK>>
            * organization_id: UUID <<PK, FK>>
            * role: VARCHAR <<PK>>
        }

        entity "medications" as medications {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            administration_route_id: UUID <<FK>>
            pharmaceutical_form_id: UUID <<FK>>
        }

        entity "administration_routes" as administration_routes {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            code: VARCHAR <<UK>>
            name: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "pharmaceutical_forms" as pharmaceutical_forms {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            code: VARCHAR <<UK>>
            name: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "active_ingredients" as active_ingredients {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            inn: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "medication_ingredients" as medication_ingredients {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            medication_id: UUID <<FK>>
            active_ingredient_id: UUID <<FK>>
            strength_value: DECIMAL
            strength_unit: VARCHAR
            strength_per_value: DECIMAL <<NULL>>
            strength_per_unit: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
        }

        entity "medication_packages" as medication_packages {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            medicinal_product_id: UUID <<FK>>
            quantity: DECIMAL
            unit: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "medication_package_gtins" as medication_package_gtins {
            * medication_package_id: UUID <<PK, FK>>
            * gtin: VARCHAR <<PK>>
        }

        entity "regulatory_authorities" as regulatory_authorities {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            name: VARCHAR
            acronym: VARCHAR
            country_iso_code: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
        }

        entity "medication_regulations" as medication_regulations {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            medicinal_product_id: UUID <<FK>>
            regulatory_authority_id: UUID <<FK>>
        }

        entity "regulatory_classifications" as regulatory_classifications {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            medication_regulation_id: UUID <<FK>>
            value: VARCHAR
            type: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "medication_classification_systems" as medication_classification_systems {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            maintainer_organization_id: UUID <<FK, NULL>>
            name: VARCHAR
            acronym: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "medication_classifications" as medication_classifications {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            medication_classification_system_id: UUID <<FK>>
            parent_medication_classification_id: UUID <<FK, NULL>>
            code: VARCHAR
            name: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "medications_medication_classifications" as medications_medication_classifications {
            * medication_id: UUID <<PK, FK>>
            * medication_classification_id: UUID <<PK, FK>>
        }
    }

    package provenance {
        entity "source_organizations" as source_organizations {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            name: VARCHAR
            acronym: VARCHAR <<UK>>
            country_iso_code: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
        }

        entity "data_sources" as data_sources {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            source_organization_id: UUID <<FK>>
            name: VARCHAR
            type: VARCHAR
            format: VARCHAR <<NULL>>
        }

        entity "data_provenances" as data_provenances {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            etl_execution_id: BIGINT <<FK, NULL>>
            subject_type: VARCHAR
            subject_id: UUID
            external_reference: VARCHAR
            extracted_at: TIMESTAMP
            role: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "etl_processes" as etl_processes {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            data_source_id: UUID <<FK>>
            name: VARCHAR
            version: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "etl_executions" as etl_executions {
            * id: BIGINT <<PK>>
            --
            etl_process_id: UUID <<FK>>
            started_at: TIMESTAMP
            finished_at: TIMESTAMP <<NULL>>
            status: VARCHAR
        }

        entity "etl_raw_artifacts" as etl_raw_artifacts {
            * id: UUID <<PK>>
            --
            etl_execution_id: BIGINT <<FK>>
            file_path: VARCHAR
            checksum: VARCHAR
            retrieved_at: TIMESTAMP
            size_in_bytes: BIGINT
            content_type: VARCHAR
        }
    }
}

medications ||--o{ medicinal_products
organizations ||--o{ medicinal_product_organizations
medicinal_products ||--o{ medicinal_product_organizations
administration_routes ||--o{ medications
pharmaceutical_forms ||--o{ medications
medicinal_products ||--o{ medication_packages
medication_packages ||--o{ medication_package_gtins
medicinal_products ||--|{ medication_regulations
regulatory_authorities ||--o{ medication_regulations
medication_regulations ||--o{ regulatory_classifications

note as ProductOrganizationsNote
Papéis possíveis:
- MANUFACTURER
- REGISTRATION_HOLDER
- MARKETING_AUTHORIZATION_HOLDER
end note
medicinal_product_organizations .. ProductOrganizationsNote

note as AdministrationRoutesNote
Tipos de administração conhecidos:
- ORAL
- SUBLINGUAL
- BUCCAL
- TOPICAL
- TRANSDERMAL
- INHALATION
- NASAL
- OPHTHALMIC
- OTIC
- RECTAL
- VAGINAL
- INTRAVENOUS
- INTRAMUSCULAR
- SUBCUTANEOUS

Constraint:
- UNIQUE (code)
end note
administration_routes .. AdministrationRoutesNote

note as PharmaceuticalFormsNote
Formas farmacêuticas conhecidas:
- TABLET
- CAPSULE
- SOLUTION
- SUSPENSION
- SYRUP
- DROPS
- CREAM
- OINTMENT
- GEL
- PATCH
- SPRAY
- AEROSOL
- POWDER
- GRANULE
- SUPPOSITORY
- INJECTION

Constraint:
- UNIQUE (code)
end note
pharmaceutical_forms .. PharmaceuticalFormsNote

note as RegulatoryAuthoritiesNote
Autoridade regulatória atual:
- ANVISA

Observação:
- country_iso_code é opcional.
end note
regulatory_authorities .. RegulatoryAuthoritiesNote

note as RegulatoryClassificationsNote
Classificações regulatórias atuais:
- Tarja vermelha
- Tarja preta
- Sem tarja (venda livre)
end note
regulatory_classifications .. RegulatoryClassificationsNote

medications ||--|{ medication_ingredients
active_ingredients ||--o{ medication_ingredients
medications ||--o{ medications_medication_classifications
medication_classifications ||--o{ medications_medication_classifications
medication_classification_systems ||--o{ medication_classifications
medication_classifications ||--o{ medication_classifications : parent
source_organizations ||--o{ medication_classification_systems : maintainer

source_organizations ||--o{ data_sources
data_sources ||--o{ etl_processes
etl_processes ||--o{ etl_executions
etl_executions ||--o{ data_provenances
etl_executions ||--o{ etl_raw_artifacts

note as SourceOrganizationsNote
Organizações fonte atuais:
- ANVISA
- CMED
- WHO
- FDA

Constraints:
- UNIQUE (acronym), quando aplicável
- country_iso_code é opcional
end note
source_organizations .. SourceOrganizationsNote

note as DataSourcesNote
Tipos possíveis:
- FILE
- API
- DATABASE
- WEB_RESOURCE

Formatos possíveis:
- CSV
- JSON
- XML
- PDF

Fontes de dados atuais:
- CSV da CMED
- CSV da ANVISA
end note
data_sources .. DataSourcesNote

note as DataProvenancesNote
Subject types possíveis:
- medicinal_products
- medications
- active_ingredients
- organizations
- medication_packages
- medication_classifications
- administration_routes
- pharmaceutical_forms
- regulatory_classifications

Papéis possíveis:
- IDENTIFICATION
- COMPOSITION
- CLASSIFICATION
- REGULATION
- PRESENTATION
- COMMERCIALIZATION

Observações:
- etl_execution_id é opcional
- subject_type evita acoplamento ao nome físico da tabela
end note
data_provenances .. DataProvenancesNote

note as ETLProcessesNote
Constraint:
- UNIQUE (name, version)
end note
etl_processes .. ETLProcessesNote

note as ETLExecutionsNote
Status possíveis:
- SUCCESS
- FAILED
- RUNNING
- CANCELED

Regras:
- finished_at é nullable enquanto status = RUNNING
- finished_at >= started_at quando preenchido
end note
etl_executions .. ETLExecutionsNote

note as ETLRawArtifactsNote
Representa o artefato bruto recuperado pela ETL:
- caminho do arquivo
- checksum
- instante de recuperação
- tamanho em bytes
- content type
end note
etl_raw_artifacts .. ETLRawArtifactsNote

note as MedicationClassificationSystemsNote
Sistemas de classificação atuais:
- EphMRA (CMED)
- ATC (OMS)
- THERAPEUTIC_CLASS (ANVISA)

Observação:
- maintainer_organization_id é opcional
end note
medication_classification_systems .. MedicationClassificationSystemsNote

note as MedicationClassificationsNote
Constraints:
- UNIQUE (medication_classification_system_id, code)
- parent deve pertencer ao mesmo sistema do filho
end note
medication_classifications .. MedicationClassificationsNote

@enduml
